<title>POLAND: Rafako plans issue for Elektrim.</title>
<headline>Rafako plans issue for Elektrim.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish industrial boiler maker Rafako SA wants to earmark its planned issue of 8.1 million shares for conglomerate Elektrim SA at 11.25 zloty per share, Rafako said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The series H share issue will be directed in a closed offer to Elektrim, which will enter a strategic partnership with Rafako,&quot; the statement said. Rafako's capital will be divided into 17.4 million shares after the issue.</p>
<p>The final decision on the issue will be made at Rafako's general shareholders' meeting on June 30. Rafako traded at 15 zlotys on Friday. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
